# selftest-inputs.list - every repository path the template self-tests
# (tests/template/test_*.sh, run by scripts/selftest.sh) read from the
# repository. One path per line: a file or a directory (directories count
# recursively, tracked and untracked-not-ignored files). Blank lines and lines
# starting with "#" are ignored. scripts/selftest-reuse.sh hashes these paths
# into the key that lets scripts/check.sh skip the self-tests when none changed;
# its verify-inputs subcommand copies ONLY these paths into a fresh repository
# and runs the whole suite there (CI), so a test that reads an undeclared path
# fails there. Under-inclusion is a defect, over-inclusion only costs a rerun:
# when a test starts reading a new path, add it here (or add its directory).
#
# Prefix "exists:" - the path must be present but its content is not hashed.
# Used for task and backlog state that changes with every task and that no
# test reads for its content (the nested started-project case in
# test_check_always.sh copies the tree, whose .work/TASK.md the outer check.sh
# lints in the same run).
#
# Audit (2026-11-17): the tests copy scripts through lib.sh cp_script, read the
# real settings and hooks (.claude, .codex), the shipped agents, skills,
# lessons, procedures, profiles, library, roster, decisions and the blueprint
# (docs), the question set (tests/docs), the quarantine list, README.md (doctor
# case), and copy the whole tree for the nested started-project case.
#
# docs/ is listed by path, not whole (audit 2026-11-18: grep of every docs/
# path the tests and the scripts they run name). Read: BLUEPRINT.md,
# ARCHITECTURE.md and operations.md (check.sh step 5b required list),
# DEFECT_MEMORY.md (dream, template-sync, start reset), and the subfolders
# procedures, rules, profiles, decisions, lessons, library, roster,
# preferences. Not read, so not declared: docs/assets and docs/research; a
# project's own new docs files and folders no longer miss reuse.

scripts
tests/template
tests/docs
tests/quarantine.list
tests/style-exempt.list
tests/BUDGET
docs/BLUEPRINT.md
docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
docs/DEFECT_MEMORY.md
docs/operations.md
docs/procedures
docs/rules
docs/profiles
docs/decisions
docs/lessons
docs/library
docs/roster
docs/preferences
.claude
.codex
.agents
.github
.archive

AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
README.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
SECURITY.md
LICENSE
manifest.md
cliff.toml
.kernel.hash
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.editorconfig

exists: BACKLOG.md
exists: BUILD_NOTES.md
exists: .work/TASK.md
exists: .work/done/.gitkeep
exists: .work/jobs/.gitkeep
